note exit trap3: an index past the array traps 3 four calls deep, with live values in registers; the
note firmware must get 2^63 | 103 (00000067) and must not see the line after the trap.
global db uchar 16

fn poke i ulong v ulong to ulong
put db i uchar v
ret add i 1
end

fn deep n ulong i ulong to ulong
if eq n 0
ret poke i 65
end
ret add 1 deep sub n 1 i
end

fn main to ulong
mark 66
hx deep 3 15
mark 84
hx deep 3 16
mark 69
ret 0
end
